        "label" : "Note",
        "value" : "Topographic map of Rome, dissected and mounted on linen, 120 x 159, folded to 21x27. Published by the Directorate, General of the Census and updated in 1866. Relief shown by hachures. Includes index to places and districts. Shows 14 districts, names of streets, public buildings, landmarks, plazas, churches, rivers, drainage, fortress and other points of interest. Some buildings shown pictorially."
      }, {
